// # Parse-fn smoke helpers
//
// Logline: Import lex and token scanners so parse-fn tests can build a token stream.
//
// Setup: Sibling token_scan_* and lex files exist in oodac/.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import scanners.
//   2. Expose helpers the test calls.
//   3. Keep parse behavior unchanged.

